{
  "description": "Plant It identification corpus: 15 real plant photos covering 10 species (the five bundled-care species Monstera, Epipremnum, Dracaena/Sansevieria, Spathiphyllum and Ficus lyrata have two photos each; Aloe, Chlorophytum, Zamioculcas, Pilea and Crassula one each) plus 3 negatives. Ground truth was set from the Wikimedia Commons file names and categories and every photo was checked by eye (spec agent, 2026-09-19). plantnetCalibration is what Pl@ntNet /v2/identify/all answered for the exact bytes in this folder on 2026-09-19 with the operator key: genus-correct top-1 on 14/15 plant photos, species-correct top-1 on 11/15 (Epipremnum pinnatum is accepted for the mature-form pothos photo; 10/15 without it), ground-truth species within the top 3 on 14/15.",
  "calibratedOn": "2026-09-19",
  "acceptedSynonyms": {
    "Sansevieria trifasciata": "Dracaena trifasciata"
  },
  "bars": {
    "genusTop1": ">= 13 of the 15 plant photos have the ground-truth genus as the top-1 candidate (live baseline 2026-09-19: 15/15)",
    "speciesTop1": ">= 9 of the 15 plant photos have a ground-truth species (or accepted synonym) as the top-1 candidate (live baseline: 14/15)",
    "speciesTop3": ">= 13 of 15 have a ground-truth species within the top 3 candidates returned by the API (live baseline: 15/15)",
    "latency": "every /api/identify round trip completes in < 10 s wall clock (live baseline: slowest 2.1 s from this Mac; the browser adds the upload)",
    "negatives": "not-a-plant-mug.jpg -> a clear \"not a plant\" message, no plant saved, no console error; too-small.jpg -> refused client-side before any request; not-an-image.txt -> not selectable, and 400 from the API",
    "lowConfidence": "a top-1 score < 0.3 comes back with lowConfidence: true (and the UI shows a warning plus the runner-up candidates); >= 0.3 with lowConfidence: false (FIX round 1 makes the API flag it)",
    "care": "every plant photo whose ground truth carries a careBar gets a care guide inside it: drought species (snake plant, ZZ, aloe, jade) wateringThreshold <= 12 and \"completely dry\" wording; peace lily >= 25 and \"moist\"; the aroids/fig 15-25 (added FIX round 1, D2)"
  },
